{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223840/extras/heading_blocks.png?t=1744913694\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn how to interact with different blocks (magnet, portal, gate, rotator, etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223840/extras/portal.gif?t=1744913694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223840/extras/spikes.gif?t=1744913694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223840/extras/heading_levels.png?t=1744913694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve 60+ hand-made levels, many of which have multiple solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223840/extras/levels.gif?t=1744913694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223840/extras/heading_commands.png?t=1744913694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use commands (step, jump, etc.) to manipulate C.U.B.E.'s position and orientation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223840/extras/commands.gif?t=1744913694\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Quick Guide</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All tests consist of Blocks. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To pass the test, move the C.U.B.E. to the Finish. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pay special attention to the block components as well as UI details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If something isn't clear, use the Database, <i>maybe</i> it will help. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://st