B.E.'s position and orientation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223840/extras/commands.gif?t=1744913694\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Quick Guide</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All tests consist of Blocks. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To pass the test, move the C.U.B.E. to the Finish. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pay special attention to the block components as well as UI details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If something isn't clear, use the Database, <i>maybe</i> it will help. </p></li></ul>","developers":["Shocking Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3223840/header.jpg?t=1744913694","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257115459,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115459/movie480.mp4?t=1744913693","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115459/movie_max.mp4?t=1744913693"},"name":"C.U.B.E. - Clever Uber Bot Extensible","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257115459/f5d9a9107af47b2c583e3f71263b79045b3f7f7e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744913693","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115459/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744913693","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115459/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744913693"}}],"name":"C.U.B.E. - Clever Uber Bot Extensible","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements